{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026TdGeFD3U9g1795156460.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>網上流傳一段車Cam影片，記錄了昨日（19日）下午5時04分在將軍澳發生的一宗驚險高空墮物事件。事發時，車Cam主正駕車駛入將軍澳廣場近停車場入口位置，期間前方突然有一個垃圾桶從天而降，墮落在停車場入口附近。湊巧當時正有一名男子在該處經過，與墮下的垃圾桶距離不足一米，險些被直接擊中，場面相當驚險；不過該名男途人逃過一劫後並未停下腳步，隨即繼續步行離開現場。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-20-14h19m59s474.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026OXJWK0aahq1795156508.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-20-14h19m47s600.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026XLLmwzdqyc1795156502.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>片主事後將車Cam片段上載至社交平台，對為何該處會有垃圾桶從高處墮下大感困惑與震驚，並發文表示：「今日喺TKO Plaza，見到一個從天而降嘅垃圾桶，個男人真係爭唔夠一米就中，咩料嗰度會有個垃圾桶跌落嚟」。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T07:44:01.805413+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":283,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T06:33:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T18:17:36.313063+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T07:37:20.947448+00:00","content_hash":"9d6f1d4f372e4b1b620545482756b3d095c7714a294c047e7e1458e15aaf7404","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T07:44:01.805413+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}